  <reporting-org ref="GB-CHC-202918" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam GB</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Effectiveness of community engagement in WASH emergencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be implemented in three different programme locations looking at different contexts ranging from rapid onsets (e.g. Bangladesh), to protracted crisis /conflict settings and disease outbreaks.  The locations will be selected based on a methodology to be developed as part of this proposal and will be based on the scale of emergency, feasibility, access, organisational / technical priority and capacity in country.</narrative>
  </description>
